      "actions": [
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "A half-burned notebook found near a collapsed floodlight tower. The surviving pages contain obsessive diagrams of the Lighthouse network.",
          "'The spacing is too regular. I checked three times. Every Lighthouse is exactly the same distance from its neighbors — not approximately, EXACTLY.'",
          "'No human surveyor is that precise. These weren't placed by engineers. They were placed by something that thinks in grids.'",
          "The Old Keeper at Outpost Balor studies the Lighthouse network. He'd want to see this."
        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "guard_post_lore_1",
      "event": "door_interacted",
